{"id": "en-f9851472-0025", "text": "The worker must wait for the lock before it touches the shared counter, otherwise two writers race and the totals drift badly. Hold the lock only for the shortest possible window and always release it before any network call, so contention stays low.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 43, "topic_id": "lock-waiting", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "f9851472-9d8a-4fcc-8c7c-3bbca4d7210b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
